Third-party material
--------------------

The public release package does not redistribute third-party source code.
MACE-Bench tasks are derived from released PyPI projects; the package ships
task definitions, researcher patches, observation probes and reference
relations authored here, plus the pinned upstream URL and SHA-256 of every
sdist.  Upstream sources are downloaded on demand by
reproduction/fetch_sdists.py and remain under their own licenses.

The historical evidence trees in the private working repository contain one
original and one patched copy of the single file each task targets.  Those
copies are excluded from the public export unless it is built with
--with-evidence, in which case the per-project LICENSE and NOTICE obligations
in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md must be satisfied before distribution.

The upstream projects referenced by MACE-Bench v2.1 are listed, with their
SPDX identifiers and redistribution conditions, in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md.

No endorsement by the upstream authors is implied.
